# Knockout Maneuver: "Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. Then it deals damage equal to its power to target creature an opponent controls."
# Bot1's Alpine Grizzly (4/2) gets the counter (5/3) and then deals 5 (not 4) to Bot2's Wall of Stone (0/8), which deals none back. The first target must be
# Bot1's own and the second an opponent's creature (the refusals).

